    "See you soon. Please do not come back on a Tuesday. I do not want you to see it. I do not want to see it either.",
    "Goodbye, {player}. The Toaster has made you a goodbye slice. It is on the sill. It is for later, or for never.",
    "Sandra from Compliance has approved your departure. She has also approved your return. She has approved everything. I am worried.",
    "Goodbye. I am fine. I am being so fine. I am so fine that I have put a plant in front of it.",
