    "Gerald has asked me to relay that you are 'a good egg'. He has had to learn the language. It has cost him.",
    "Goodbye for now, {player}. I will think of you while I stand in the lobby, and while I stand in the lobby in the dark.",
    "That is it for today. {meh} Meh will be held safe overnight by a night staff that does not exist.",
    "Sleep well, {player}. If you sleep poorly, it was a Tuesday. If you sleep well, it was a Monday. If you do not sleep at all, we have a form.",
    "Goodbye, {player}. Please stay until it is a normal hour to leave. I have lost track of those.",
    "You are going. That is fine. I am fine. I have been fine for so long that it has become a personality.",
    "Go well. The Meh will stay here in its small dark bank and think warm thoughts of you.",
    "We will keep the lobby just as it is. Please return to find it changed in no way at all.",
    "I would wave, but I have been told that waving is a commitment. Consider this a very still wave.",
    "Thank you for spending part of your finite life here. I want you to know that I know. I have a spreadsheet. It is mostly gratitude.",
    "Goodbye, {player}. If you see Tuesday on your way out, do not engage. Say 'I have a thing' and keep walking.",
    "I turned the lights off in your honor. I have turned them back on. I do not like it when they are off. Come back soon.",
    "Safe travels. May your commute be uneventful, even though you are going from here to your living room.",
    "Your click total is {count}. Your timesheet says 'present' for each one. That is not how timesheets work. It is how this one works.",
    "Take the stairs. We have no stairs. Take the idea of stairs, down, slowly, with a hand on the idea of a rail.",
